// Nordmark Exec - DAX control-total tests (ADR-0013 incl. (k) period model; docs/Requirements-exec.md ET-01 .. ET-32).
// Generated from data/nordmark_retail_dummy_data/checks/control_totals_eur.csv (26,143 rows, 93 keys, seed 20261028): the 24,289 rows
// of the 87 item keys are all in T-N1; the 6 legacy PTD- / YTD- keys are retired here (their values live on as P-FY2026-10, FY-FY2026, ...).
// Run each '// ==== BLOCK' as its own query (DAX query view or ADOMD; a whole-file run runs out of memory); every row must return _pass = TRUE.
// Tolerances as checks/verify.py: amounts 0.0051, units / SKU-days 0.06, ratios 1e-6, counts and status codes exact; expected BLANK = absent (N/A).
// T-N1 base layer per scope x key (window = dim_week rows) | T-N2 card layer through the picker slicers (type x item x comparator x scope)
// T-N3 texts (texts: v5 at Reset and the saved state (ET-02, ET-22); headers, titles, phrases per item; comparator lines and short suffixes; Year hides Previous (ET-23); EBITDA Previous at Week (ET-31); FY2025 N/A (ET-26); picker fallbacks (ET-28); Online N/A) | T-N4 bars per type | T-N5 identities (ET-07, ET-12) | T-N6 conceal in place (ET-13) | T-N7 i pop-up stacked block (USER 2026-10-30): Actual label, value, swatch + basis label, target value, delta, in this order, whatever the comparator; no basis = label + muted dash; no footer target, owner note, Horizon or Statement (E-57, ET-30, ET-32) | T-N8 item lists
// T-N9 frame parity: every card face and i pop-up shows the card-layer value, delta, chip, basis and status word; status line and dot tip show the window status pack (9 picker states, 2 with a category pick)
// T-N10 category scopes: all 10,514 rows of control_totals_category_eur.csv + the N/A rows of the EBITDA / OTIF families, sell-through without a seasonal category and the mini stats outside the pick (ET-33, ET-34)
// Rows: 50,390 (T-N1 27,231; T-N2 + T-N4 6,648; T-N5 27; T-N10 15,974; string rows 510).

// ==== BLOCK T-N1-ALL-W26: base layer, scope ALL, keys W-FY2026-30 .. W-FY2026-43 (ET-01)
EVALUATE
